om/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"unlabeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-10-19T12:36:38Z","label":{"name":"requires triage","color":"ffff00"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/712129296","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5656#issuecomment-712129296","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5656","id":712129296,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxMjEyOTI5Ng==","user":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-19T12:40:52Z","updated_at":"2020-10-19T12:40:52Z","body":"hey there.    a tip on MCVEs, you have a reproduction case there, and it works, that's great!   that showed me where the problem is.  But i had to do a lot of work first.    For example, I don't have zope installed, and in fact your program has no need to register a session with zope.  it creates a Session(), but this also is not even used in the example program.   you should make sure you remove *all* of these things that aren't needed to reproduce the bug.\r\n\r\nBelow MCVE is a reasonable minimal reproduction case.\r\n\r\n```\r\n#!/usr/bin/env python\r\n\r\nimport sqlalchemy as sqla\r\nimport sqlalchemy\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import literal_column\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import MetaData\r\nfrom sqlalchemy import Table\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.dialects import mysql\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.dialects.mysql import insert as mysql_insert\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.ext.compiler import compiles\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.schema import Column\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.schema import DDLElement\r\nfrom sqlalchemy.types import Integer\r\n\r\n\r\nclass Trigger(object):\r\n    def __init__(self, name, target, query):\r\n        self.name = name\r\n        self.target = target\r\n        self.query = query\r\n\r\n\r\nclass CreateTrigger(DDLElement):\r\n    def __init__(self, trigger):\r\n        self.trigger = trigger\r\n\r\n\r\n@compiles(CreateTrigger, \"mysql\")\r\ndef visit_create_trigger_mysql(element, compiler, **kw):\r\n    sql_compiler = compiler.sql_compiler\r\n    compiled_query = sql_compiler.process(\r\n        element.trigger.query, literal_binds=True\r\n    )\r\n\r\n    return \"\"\"\r\n        CREATE OR REPLACE TRIGGER %(name)s ON %(target_table_name)s\r\n            FOR EACH ROW\r\n                %(query)s\r\n            \"\"\" % dict(\r\n        name=element.trigger.name,\r\n        target_table_name=element.trigger.target.name,\r\n        query=compiled_query,\r\n    )\r\n\r\n\r\ninto_table = Table(\r\n    \"t\",\r\n    MetaData(),\r\n    Column(\"user_id\", Integer, primary_key=True),\r\n    Column(\"total\", Integer),\r\n)\r\ninsert = mysql_insert(into_table).from_select(\r\n    [into_table.c.user_id, into_table.c.total],\r\n    sqla.select([literal_column(\"NEW.user_id\"), literal_column(\"NEW.value\")]),\r\n)\r\nupsert = insert.on_duplicate_key_update(\r\n    total=insert.inserted.total + into_table.c.total\r\n)\r\n\r\n\r\ntrg = Trigger(\"trg\", into_table, upsert)\r\n\r\nprint(CreateTrigger(trg).compile(dialect=mysql.dialect()))\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\nthe on dupe elements make the assumption the compiler has a statement, which in the case of running it within a trigger that's at the DDL level, they don't.   so best that they no longer rely upon this assumption.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/712129296/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/712130227","html_url":"https://github.com/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5656#issuecomment-712130227","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/5656","id":712130227,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDcxMjEzMDIyNw==","user":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-10-19T12:42:42Z","updated_at":"2020-10-19T12:42:42Z","body":"patch for MySQL, however this also needs postgresql and needs tests that these constructs don't rely upon .statement:\r\n\r\n```\r\ndiff --git a/lib/sqlalchemy/dialects/mysql/base.py b/lib/sqlalchemy/dialects/mysql/base.py\r\nindex 3e6c676ab..e1e833408 100644\r\n--- a/lib/sqlalchemy/dialects/mysql/base.py\r\n+++ b/lib/sqlalchemy/dialects/mysql/base.py\r\n@@ -1461,6 +1461,8 @@ class MySQLCompiler(compiler.SQLCompiler):\r\n         return self._render_json_extract_from_binary(binary, operator, **kw)\r\n \r\n     def visit_on_duplicate_key_update(self, on_duplicate, **kw):\r\n+        orig_statement = self.stack[-1]['selectable']\r\n+\r\n         if on_duplicate._parameter_ordering:\r\n             parameter_ordering = [\r\n                 coercions.expect(roles.DMLColumnRole, key)\r\n@@ -1468,14 +1470,14 @@ class MySQLCompiler(compiler.SQLCompiler):\r\n             ]\r\n             ordered_keys = set(parameter_ordering)\r\n             cols = [\r\n-                self.statement.table.c[key]\r\n+                orig_statement.table.c[key]\r\n                 for key in parameter_ordering\r\n-                if key in self.statement.table.c\r\n+                if key in orig_statement.table.c\r\n             ] + [\r\n-                c for c in self.statement.table.c if c.key not in ordered_keys\r\n+                c for c in orig_statement.table.c if c.key not in ordered_keys\r\n             ]\r\n         else:\r\n-            cols = self.statement.table.c\r\n+            cols = orig_statement.table.c\r\n \r\n         clauses = []\r\n         # traverses through all table columns to preserve table column order\r\n@@ -1520,7 +1522,7 @@ class MySQLCompiler(compiler.SQLCompiler):\r\n                 \"Additional column names not matching \"\r\n                 \"any column keys in table '%s': %s\"\r\n                 % (\r\n-                    self.statement.table.name,\r\n+                    orig_statement.table.name,\r\n                     (\", \".join(\"'%s'\" % c for c in non_matching)),\r\n                 )\r\n             )\r\n\r\n```","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sqlalchemy/sqlalchemy/issues/comments/712130227/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"zzzeek","id":128223,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyODIyMw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/128223?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek","html_url":"https://github.com/zzzeek","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zzzeek/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"ht